## Import

Import existing resource

### Using Import block (terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_runner_group.example-runner-group
  id = "runner-group-name"
}
```

### Using CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_runner_group.example-runner-group runner-group-name
```

